# Vertical shop sign (R23 wall mount): a tall cream blade with dark glyph strokes and a magenta tube edge, on two
# steel arms. Reads as lettering without being any real word.
grid 10
size 8 4 34
slot arm Steel
slot face Paper
slot edge PaperEdge
slot glyph Ink
pivot 0 2 0
box 0 1 4 4 3 5 arm
box 0 1 29 4 3 30 arm
box 3 0 2 8 4 32 edge
box 4 0 3 7 4 31 face
paint box 4 0 6 7 4 7 glyph
paint box 5 0 9 7 4 12 glyph
paint box 4 0 14 6 4 15 glyph
paint box 4 0 17 7 4 18 glyph
paint box 5 0 20 6 4 24 glyph
paint box 4 0 26 7 4 27 glyph
